</div>




















  
  



</div></div></div><div class="col sqs-col-9 span-9"><div class="sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html" data-block-type="2" data-border-radii="&#123;&quot;topLeft&quot;:&#123;&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0&#125;,&quot;topRight&quot;:&#123;&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0&#125;,&quot;bottomLeft&quot;:&#123;&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0&#125;,&quot;bottomRight&quot;:&#123;&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0&#125;&#125;" data-sqsp-block="text" id="block-8f8199bbcf19b6f6f841"><div class="sqs-block-content">

<div class="sqs-html-content" data-sqsp-text-block-content>
  <p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">It's easy to reserve space for your next performance or rehearsal at Brava Theater Center. We offer competitive rates and are located in San Francisco's eclectic, restaurant-filled Mission District. Brava is transit-accessible, just a 10-minute walk from BART, and close to the freeway. Parking is available just two blocks away.</p><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Brava has three performance spaces available for rent in one convenient location.&nbsp;Contact us now to reserve the&nbsp;<strong>Main Theater,&nbsp;</strong>the second stage&nbsp;<strong>Studio</strong>, or our street level&nbsp;<strong>Cabaret</strong>.</p><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">If you are interested in renting one of Brava’s three spaces, please email our Rentals and Events Manager, Lottie Pacheco, at lottie@brava.org.</p><p class="" data-rte-preserve-empty="true" style="white-space:pre-wrap;"></p>
</div>




















  
  



</div></div></div></div><div class="row sqs-row"><div class="col sqs-col-3 span-3"><div class="sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html" data-block-type="2" data-border-radii="&#123;&quot;topLeft&quot;:&#123;&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0&#125;,&quot;topRight&quot;:&#123;&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0&#125;,&quot;bottomLeft&quot;:&#123;&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0&#125;,&quot;bottomRight&quot;:&#123;&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0&#125;&#125;" data-sqsp-block="text" id="block-yui_3_17_2_1_1655761646875_52160"><div class="sqs-block-content">

<div class="sqs-html-content" data-sqsp-text-block-content>
  <h2 style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Rental Services</h2>
</div>




















  
  



</div></div></div><div class="col sqs-col-9 span-9"><div class="sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html" data-block-type="2" data-border-radii="&#123;&quot;topLeft&quot;:&#123;&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0&#125;,&quot;topRight&quot;:&#123;&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0&#125;,&quot;bottomLeft&quot;:&#123;&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0&#125;,&quot;bottomRight&quot;:&#123;&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0&#125;&#125;" data-sqsp-block="text" id="block-yui_3_17_2_1_1655761646875_18648"><div class="sqs-block-content">

<div class="sqs-html-content" data-sqsp-text-block-content>
  <h3 style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Front-of-House</h3><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">At Brava Theater you can relax knowing that your lobby set-up, ushers, and ticket takers will be managed by our friendly and professional staff. All clients hire a Brava house manager. We provide a short orientation (one half hour) for your ushers and ticket takers before doors open. If you choose, for a small fee, Brava can hire experienced ushers and ticket takers for your event.<br>&nbsp;</p><h3 style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Box Office</h3><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Take advantage of Brava’s ticketing service, in-house publicity experts, and well-trafficked ticket booth.</p>
</div>




















  
  



</div></div></div></div><div class="sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-horizontalrule horizontalrule-block" data-block-css="[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.horizontalrule/a5f3f37f-59b8-407b-a918-612176f66206_447/website.components.horizontalrule.styles.css&quot;]" data-block-scripts="[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.horizontalrule/a5f3f37f-59b8-407b-a918-612176f66206_447/website.components.horizontalrule.visitor.js&quot;]" data-block-type="1337" data-definition-name="website.components.horizontalrule" data-sqsp-block="line" data-website-component-id="yui_3_17_2_1_1655757677819_67049" id="block-yui_3_17_2_1_1655757677819_67049"><div class="sqs-block-content">
<div>
  <hr />
  <style class="transform-overrides-vars">
  
</style>

  



</div>
</div></div><div class="sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html" data-block-type="2" data-border-radii="&#123;&quot;topLeft&quot;:&#123;&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0&#125;,&quot;topRight&quot;:&#123;&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0&#125;,&quot;bottomLeft&quot;:&#123;&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0&#125;,&quot;bottomRight&quot;:&#123;&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0&#125;&#125;" data-sqsp-block="text" id="block-yui_3_17_2_1_1655761646875_47633"><div class="sqs-block-content">

