<div class="sqs-html-content" data-sqsp-text-block-content>
  <p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Capacity: 80<br></p><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Our Main Theater Lobby is a wonderful space to hold gatherings such as receptions, dinners, and talks. It can be booked as a stand alone venue or in conjunction with an event on our Main Stage.</p>
</div>




















  
  



