<figure class="sqs-quote-block-contents block-animation-none">
  <blockquote data-animation-role="quote"
  >
    <span>“</span>Thank you for making our storytellers’ showcase so seamless and special for our students and families. It was very meaningful to hold the event in such a beautiful, historic, and convenient location. We are deeply grateful for your staff’s hard work and flexibility.<span>”</span>
  </blockquote>
  <figcaption class="source">&mdash; Christina and all of us at 826 Valencia</figcaption>
  



</figure>



  
