  <blockquote data-animation-role="quote"
  >
    <span>“</span>The event was wonderful. We had a good turnout and the venue worked very well for our event. The House Manager was also very helpful and we really appreciate all the help and accommodations on your part. We look forward to other events in the future at Brava. Thanks much.<span>”</span>
